<title>ESTONIA: VILJANDI TOWN TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</title>
<headline>VILJANDI TOWN TO ISSUE NEW CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viljandi, a town in central Estonia, on Friday will issue 26 million kroons in commercial papers, Talinvest investment house said.</p>
<p>The three month commercial papers have a yield of eight percent, Rain Nuka, project leader with Talinvest, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
